message: "If you use this framework in academic work, analysis, or product strategy, please cite it as below."
title: "The Supply Chain of Intelligence — the 10 layers of the generative AI stack"
abstract: >-
  An open structural framework for analyzing where value is created, captured,
  and defended in generative AI products. Defines 10 layers (L−1 Resources
  through L8 Memory), 50 sublayers, three tiers (Substrate, Workflow, Surface),
  four structural Laws, three Currents, the Intelligence Cube, and six company
  archetypes. Distinct from the conventional AI stack, which describes how AI
  is built; this framework describes where AI value accrues.
